KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp17 --object-bits 12
^\[apply\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ handler ran through std::function: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
Calling through a std::function bound to a lambda does not invoke the
closure; the callee sees unconstrained arguments.  Blocks dog-fooding
the with_solver_hardness callers.
